@baseUrl = https://localhost:7001
@accessToken = REPLACE_WITH_ACCESS_TOKEN
@cityId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

# TODO : Configure real IDs and URL. User identity comes from the access token.
### Onboarding state
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/onboarding
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Important approximate public place
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/onboarding/anchors
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"cityId":"{{cityId}}","placeId":null,"label":"Public meeting place","latitude":35.75,"longitude":51.41}
